# Bundled default-PSK database for autopwn-ng
# Format: <OUI_PREFIX (6 hex uppercase)>  <algorithm|default PSK>  [# comment]
# algorithm names: speedtouch, thomson, alice, dlink, netgear, tplink, huawei, generic
# Lines starting with # are comments.
C83A35  speedtouch   # SpeedTouch/Thomson
00147F  thomson      # Thomson
002196  alice        # Alice/AGPF (Telecom Italia)
00238E  alice        # Alice/AGPF
0024B2  dlink        # D-Link (default often admin/blank)
001F33  netgear      # Netgear (serial-based on some models)
001D0F  tplink       # TP-Link (MAC-suffix on some models)
00E0FC  huawei       # Huawei (common defaults)
001122  generic      # test fixture
EOF